INSERT INTO `style_generations` VALUES (1,'JOB-86DB2537',1,3,'/static/media/generated/gen_style_3_4cbcaf870e.jpg','Modify only the hairstyle. Apply the approved Modern Pompadour Undercut (Trendy style, Medium length) tailored for an Square face shape. Preserve the customer\'s identity, exact facial structure, skin tone, eyes, eyebrows, nose, lips, ears, pose, clothing, camera angle, lighting, and background. Make the hairstyle hyper-realistic, professional, seamless, and consistent with the customer\'s existing hair characteristics.','COMPLETED',100,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-01 18:23:16'),(2,'JOB-86DB2537',1,1,'/static/media/generated/gen_style_1_6249673b4c.jpg','Modify only the hairstyle. Apply the approved Low Taper Fade + Textured Top (Trendy style, Short length) tailored for an Square face shape. Preserve the customer\'s identity, exact facial structure, skin tone, eyes, eyebrows, nose, lips, ears, pose, clothing, camera angle, lighting, and background. Make the hairstyle hyper-realistic, professional, seamless, and consistent with the customer\'s existing hair characteristics.','COMPLETED',100,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-01 18:23:16'),(3,'JOB-86DB2537',1,5,'/static/media/generated/gen_style_5_9f53c41006.jpg','Modify only the hairstyle. Apply the approved Messy Textured Fringe (Trendy style, Medium length) tailored for an Square face shape. Preserve the customer\'s identity, exact facial structure, skin tone, eyes, eyebrows, nose, lips, ears, pose, clothing, camera angle, lighting, and background. Make the hairstyle hyper-realistic, professional, seamless, and consistent with the customer\'s existing hair characteristics.','COMPLETED',100,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-10-01 18:23:16'),(4,'JOB-86DB2537',1,8,'/static/media/generated/gen_style_8_4476f6a22e.jpg','Modify only the hairstyle. Apply the approved Textured Quiff + Mid Taper (Trendy style, Medium length) tailored for an Square face shape. Preserve the customer\'s identity, exact facial struc